# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice in particular that $J(\\operatorname{Id})$ is not the identity matrix.\n"
"The Choi representation does not directly describe a channel's action in the usual way that a matrix represents a linear mapping.\n"
msgstr ""
"Observă în particular că $J(\\operatorname{Id})$ nu este matricea identitate.\n"
